So the real flow is:

new feature file created
Git push triggers workflow
npm run bdd:gen converts feature to runner spec
Playwright runs generated spec
Azure Playwright service executes the test
Allure report is generated
artifacts are uploaded

If you want the same exact local sequence before pushing:
npm ci
npm run bdd:gen
npx playwright test --config=playwright.service.config.js --workers=4
npx allure generate ./allure-results --clean -o allure-report